"""vit_processor.py - Vitesse ToF laser-ablation map processor (single file).

Open in IDLE and press F5, or run: python vit_processor.py [file.vit]
Needs: numpy scipy pandas scikit-learn PyQt6 pyqtgraph
Part 1 is the GUI-free core (loading, calibration, selection maths, export). Part 2 is the PyQt6 front end.
"""

