                     "204Pb layer removes contaminated pixels inside the grain as well. Outliers are removed after the edge and filters, per curve. "
                     "MSWD uses the 1 sigma you set here because pixel ages carry no individual error. It is a check of scatter against that "
                     "error, and neighbouring pixels are not independent, so read it as a guide. Pixels removed are shown on the map: green kept, "
